OL,3,GNEWSACancer patient does 100th parkrun
OL,4,Aafter transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had chemotherapy and while
OL,7,Frecovering from the transplant he
OL,8,Frealised he was just four runs away
OL,9,Ffrom the 100 parkrun milestone. "When I
OL,10,Fwas in hospital I always set goals and
OL,11,Fwas determined to get myself better
OL,12,Fagain," he said.
